[statement]
A package whose condition names two names steers neither choice that
completes it, the later name's included: `a`'s condition is `e d`, `d` 3
is the best candidate for `d`, and `a` needs `w`, which only `d` 1
provides. apk takes `d` 3 and passes `a` over, as
`a-package-whose-condition-holds-does-not-steer-the-choice-completing-it`.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:w
i:e d

P:d
V:3

P:d
V:1
p:w=2

P:e
V:1

[request]
d
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 3
install e 1
